<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mrs. Tubman returns for her test results and a headache check four weeks after starting candesartan 8 mg. Four of her typical spells were captured during the ambulatory EEG, and the overnight and daytime sleep studies are complete. Her sleep spells continue several times a day. Her headache diary shows fewer headache days than before, though still more than she would like, and she has used acetaminophen about once a week, with no ibuprofen since the first visit. She has had no dizziness on standing, swelling, or cough on candesartan. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Testing completed</td><td>Ambulatory EEG with video, overnight polysomnography, and multiple sleep latency test</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep spells</td><td>Unchanged, several a day</td></tr><tr><td>Headache diary</td><td>Fewer headache days since starting candesartan; partial response</td></tr><tr><td>Acute medicine</td><td>Acetaminophen about once a week; no ibuprofen</td></tr><tr><td>Candesartan tolerance</td><td>No dizziness, swelling, or cough</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
